  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> the average hand length is <strong>7.6&nbsp;inches (19.3&nbsp;cm) for men</strong> and <strong>7.1&nbsp;inches (18.0&nbsp;cm) for women</strong>. Average hand breadth is 3.5&nbsp;in for men and 3.1&nbsp;in for women.</p></div>

